  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decentralization reforms in the DRC have been extremely slow and are unlikely to be implemented effectively overnight given the many challenges ahead. Among these, we can pinpoint those related to the issue of local governance following the repeated postponement, despite the holding of three electoral cycles (2005-2006;2010-2011 and 2016-2018), of the electoral consultations for the establishment of the ETD&apos;s own management bodies.</narrative>
